<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-VICTORIA V QUEENSLAND SHEFFIELD SHIELD MATCH DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-VICTORIA V QUEENSLAND SHEFFIELD SHIELD MATCH DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in a four-day Sheffield</p>
<p>Shield match on Saturday.</p>
<p>In Melbourne (final day): Victoria drew with Queensland.</p>
<p>Victoria 191 and 213 for eight. Queensland 229 and 355 for four</p>
<p>declared (Matthew Mott 150, Jimmy Maher 95).</p>
</text>
